Dear Sir or Madam,

I write to notify the Ombudsman that Judicial Review proceedings have now b=
een issued and served in Zahmoul v Secretary of State for Justice & HMCTS (A=
C-2025-LON-004293).

The claim concerns:
=E2=80=A2 alleged misadministration of court-controlled electronic material with =
potential criminal relevance; and
=E2=80=A2 systemic administrative failures affecting a vulnerable litigant.

Given the overlap with issues previously raised in my PHSO complaint, I pro=
vide this update for transparency.

A public archive of officially filed documents is available at:
https://github.com/nadiazahmoul/JR-Zahmoul-v-SSJ-HMCTS-Archive

Yours faithfully,
Nadia Zahmoul

=20

